     "id": "a83cdcc",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>The Schnitz kids menu, called <strong>Little Rascals</strong>, was refreshed with two main options: the <strong>Kiddy Schnugget Pack</strong> and the <strong>Teeny Weeny</strong>. Both come as a complete meal with mini chips and a drink, which makes them an easy choice for younger eaters.</p><p>The Kiddy Schnugget Pack launched at around <strong>$11 (approx.)</strong>. Prices vary between stores, so check with your local Schnitz.</p>"
     },
